<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_385bfa5f-03c5-4680-ab77-5ffa34907879"
id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act may be cited as the <legref jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown" refid="act-1930-038"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Farrer
Memorial Research Scholarship Fund Act
1930</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_26845a18-4612-4f1d-9d1d-935a976ebe87"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_b0a8dfc0-e1d0-4a29-a807-da30fdbaec54"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act&#8212;</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_97cba31f-5a29-4325-b56a-5dba4d7421f9"
id="def.Department"><b><i>Department</i></b></defterm> means Regional
NSW.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_111fa419-2428-4622-8962-19a6ccde51c7"
id="def.Secretary"><b><i>Secretary</i></b></defterm> means the Secretary of
the Department.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_80e56f82-ad33-4dc2-aef7-489cadc14c67" id="def.Thefund"><b><i>The
fund</i></b></defterm> means the moneys formerly held by the late Frederick
Bickell Guthrie, George Washington Walker, the late Henry Lord, and the
Under-Secretary of the Department of Agriculture, and the Principal of the
Hawkesbury Agricultural College at Richmond, in connection with the Farrer
Memorial Fund, amounting at or shortly before the commencement of this Act to
the sum of about two thousand eight hundred and forty-eight pounds seventeen
shillings and ten pence, and the investments for the time being representing
the same together with all interest accrued and accruing
thereon.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_8ac3bee5-94f7-4b41-a7a0-e050db0bda2c"
id="def.Trustees"><b><i>Trustees</i></b></defterm> means the trustees of the
fund appointed by or under this Act.</txt></block></deflist>
</block>

<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 2:</b> Am 2004 No 91,
Sch 1.12 [1]; 2010 No 59, Sch 2.31; 2019 No 14, Sch 2.7[1] [2]; 2020 No 30,
Sch 3.11.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_4b3297f0-dfdb-4546-bb2e-01bf8f711503"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_d10ccc9f-8fb4-4bd4-9e70-14c24aad9d40"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Trustees</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Honourable Alfred Edgar Hunt, Member of the
Legislative Council, Thomas Irving Campbell, of Tabbita, in the State of New
South Wales, farmer, George Washington Walker, of Sydney, in the said State,
grain merchant, or their successors appointed under this Act (in this Act
referred to as the non-official trustees) together with the persons who for
the time being respectively hold the offices of Dean of the Faculty of
Agriculture of the University of Sydney, Secretary (or the Secretary&#8217;s
nominee), a Deputy Secretary of the Department nominated by the Secretary and
an officer of the Commonwealth Scientific and Industrial Research Organisation
nominated by the Minister (which said persons are in this Act referred to as
the official trustees) shall be the trustees of the fund.</txt></block>

<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 3:</b> Am 1974 No 70,
sec 2 (a); 1993 No 46, Sch 2; 2004 No 91, Sch 1.12 [2] [3]; 2019 No 14, Sch
2.7[3].</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_22bc9577-a1f0-4244-981a-a7d55890f360"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_f82dd012-dea4-46b1-b150-c21e682408ac"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Majority of trustees to act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The trustees shall be entitled to act by a
majority of those present at any meeting duly convened, at which a quorum
shall be three.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_9d9e1022-4e50-463d-97f0-fb8ca10a8d1a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_6cd81cc5-cd67-4658-bd74-168a6713cebe"
id="sec.5-he"><b>New trustees</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_dae93e56-614b-43ec-9ce6-7ffa5a26b647"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A new trustee may be appointed in the place of
any non-official trustee by the Governor and the appointment signified by
notification published in the Gazette in any of the following
cases&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_2acc34b6-27aa-4d0a-a085-3d60d5d08a3e" id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">where a trustee is dead,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f95b233c-309a-4f88-9a48-2bc12f7e554b" id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">where a trustee remains out of New South Wales
for more than one year without the consent of the
trustees,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b3e3cedc-f11f-4336-809b-c4e176bf22c9" id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">where a trustee desires to be discharged from all
or any of the trusts or powers reposed in or conferred on him, or resigns his
office by letter addressed to the Minister,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c4c02304-f8b2-467f-bec7-3ed8a05e2552" id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">where a trustee refuses or is unfit to act in
such trusts or powers, or is incapable of acting
therein.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_63a1a221-7453-4205-ac98-960bc31bf7c6"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Upon any such appointment being so notified the
fund shall by virtue of this Act vest in the new trustee so appointed jointly
with the continuing trustees.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ea4184d7-37e2-4021-a7d2-68ce1577cae2"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Upon any change in the holder of any office
referred to in section three the fund shall by virtue of this Act vest jointly
in the successor in the office whose holder is changed and the continuing
trustees.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_4d3baee3-7948-43f4-9f6b-bc1cf34dcb62"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_f084364c-b1c4-4d8f-bd62-fef0c1fbace0"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Transfer and investment of fund and application of
proceeds</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5615d7e3-a4f6-4aba-9589-5aee14a56eea"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The fund is hereby vested in the trustees, and
shall by them be invested in any of the securities authorised by the <legref
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown" refid="act-1925-014"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Trustee Act 1925</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ddb62de4-32d3-4227-8586-164da2b11f51"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The interest arising from the investment of the
fund shall be expended, in such amounts as from time to time are determined by
the trustees&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_a370365d-8307-4d6e-b71a-9914ac7d7879" id="sec.6-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">in enabling any person selected by the trustees
to carry out study or research in agricultural problems,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_7fa5d13a-f949-4da3-b419-b98dce46d59d" id="sec.6-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">at the discretion of the trustees, in
paying&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b5161cc6-acaa-4a78-9483-27fa5021985a"
id="sec.6-ssec.2-para1.b-para2.i">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the whole or part of the costs and expenses of
the delivery of an annual Farrer Memorial Oration and the annual presentation
of medal, known as the Farrer Memorial Medal, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_d21bc67f-210c-4da7-9449-52937961afae"
id="sec.6-ssec.2-para1.b-para2.ii">
<no>(ii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">an honorarium to the recipient of the Farrer
Memorial Medal.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 6:</b> Am 1974 No 70,
sec 2 (b).</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d1682568-6b2d-405c-90b5-dbd6b80b2e09"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_7ee017e8-c082-417e-b303-0408a45ca59b"
id="sec.7-he"><b>Power of trustees as to investigation and person to make
same</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The trustees shall have power to indicate or
direct the nature of the investigation which will be accepted by them as
conforming to the objects of the fund referred to in section 6 (2) (a), and
also to select the person who, in their opinion, has the necessary
qualifications for the particular class of work to be
undertaken.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1">Any person so selected shall be appointed by the
trustees as a Farrer Memorial Research Scholar for such period as the trustees
may determine.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1">Any appointment so made may be revoked by the
trustees if they are satisfied after inquiry that the conduct or work of such
holder is such that he should no longer retain the scholarship.</txt></block>

<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 7:</b> Am 1974 No 70,
sec 2 (c).</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_4d0911ee-324c-405f-9cda-00ef48146bc2"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading guid="_32c6442a-a154-4477-97ef-62d1553656ce"
id="sec.8-he"><b>Further endowments</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The trustees may accept any sums of money given
to them to be applied for the same purposes as those to which the fund is to
be applied, and any such sum shall be deemed to be part of the
fund.</txt></block></level>


