<level type="historicalnotes">
<head><heading guid="_ac5dfe4d-36cd-4b79-beb5-1f948b5fad8d"
id="ed-he"><b>Historical notes</b></heading></head>

<level type="tableleg">
<head><heading guid="_c9ecfbbf-f91b-4a9b-ac12-0b1e8a952b15"
id="ed-he-oc.2"><b>Table of amending instruments</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1"><legref jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"
refid="act-1930-038"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Farrer Memorial Research
Scholarship Fund Act 1930</i></name> No 38</legref>. Assented to 25.6.1930.
This Act has been amended as follows&#8212;</txt>

<table frame="none" orient="port" heading.align="left" font.size="12.pt"
